tly the forecast. Actual demand averages about 4.6% above forecast, so stock drifts down and shortage penalties build up. It's the weakest of the daily plans.\n- **Plan 2** orders about 15% extra of item 1, which has the higher penalty (8 vs 5). I put it in the top four, narrowly ahead of plan 3.\n- **Plan 3** adds about 8% to both items. It's close to plan 2.\n- **Plan 4** adds about 5% and places large orders at the end, which mostly go to waste.\n- **Plan 5** orders too little on day 0, causing early shortages, and cuts orders at the end.\n\nThe fourth spot (plan 2 over plan 3) is the least certain call."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5048, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5048}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T07:52:07.419Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWAVXED9ZWVR47uc9Hjz"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_0166PExDDa82XnynGNRGXzSL", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWAVXVLPjjZZQG9FKsZs", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_0166PExDDa82XnynGNRGXzSL", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.2, 0.68, 0.52, 0.48, 0.35, 0.3, 0.75, 0.72]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "ca